### Fault transition
POST {{baseUrl}}/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{vehicleToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-24T00:02:00Z",
  "lat": 37.4305,
  "lon": -122.0605,
  "battery_pct": 45,
  "speed_mps": 0,
  "status": "fault",
  "error_codes": ["F_MOTOR"],
  "zone_entered": "maintenance_bay"
}

### Out-of-order telemetry persists but should not overwrite current state
POST {{baseUrl}}/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{vehicleToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-23T23:59:00Z",
  "lat": 37.4000,
  "lon": -122.0900,
  "battery_pct": 99,
  "speed_mps": 0,
  "status": "idle",
  "error_codes": [],
  "zone_entered": null
}

