### Create token for another vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/vehicle-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "{{otherVehicleId}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("otherVehicleToken", response.body.token);
%}

### Token vehicle_id mismatch rejection - should return 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{vehicleToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "{{otherVehicleId}}",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-24T00:04:00Z",
  "lat": 37.41,
  "lon": -122.08,
  "battery_pct": 80,
  "speed_mps": 1.0,
  "status": "moving",
  "error_codes": [],
  "zone_entered": null
}

### Unknown zone validation - should return 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{vehicleToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-24T00:05:00Z",
  "lat": 37.41,
